id: saiyan-raised
name: Saiyan-Raised
order: 15
category: mind
# A Factor Trait replaces a Secondary Racial Trait.
importance: secondary
description: >
  Trained relentlessly by the proud warrior Saiyans, you have earned your right to call yourself a warrior.
text: >
  Saiyan-Raised (Mind): Trained relentlessly by the proud warrior Saiyans, you have earned your right to call yourself a warrior.
  (1)-[Passive]: Increase your Wound Rolls and Surgency by 1(T) for every Health Threshold you are below.
  (2)-[Passive]: While you are below the Injured Health Threshold, increase your Soak Value by 1(T).
  (3)-[Passive]: Ignore all Health Threshold Penalties while in the Superior State.
  (4)-[Triggered, 1/Encounter]: If you take Damage from an Opponent’s Attacking Maneuver, you may use the Basic Attack Maneuver as an Out-of-Sequence Maneuver. If you do, you are in the Superior State for the duration of this Attacking Maneuver.
  (5)-[Triggered/Power, 1/Encounter]: If you are below the Injured Health Threshold, enter the Superior State until the end of your next turn.

---

[passive]
# (1)
wound.perThreshold += 1(T);
surgency.perThreshold += 1(T);
# (2)
if (belowThreshold("injured")) {
    soakValue += 1(T);
}
# (3)
if (inState("superior")) {
    threshold.penalty = 0;
}
# (4) Damage from an Opponent's attack: the Basic Attack offered on its card, once an Encounter - Superior as it is made, left as it is
# done (chat.mjs applyAttackDamage, attackDurationEnds).
allow saiyanRaised.strike;

# (5) The Power Up Maneuver, Injured or worse. Automatic by default, its Triggered/Automatic button.
[triggered/power, 1/encounter, effect 5]
requires belowThreshold("injured");
enterState(superior, 1, next-turn);
